Description:

Parsing a relative IMAP URL that begins with ";" -- one whose mailbox part is
empty -- no longer looks at the byte before the start of the URL.  Previously
that byte was read, and overwritten if it happened to be "/".

Tracked as GitHub security advisory GHSA-wv9j-8jcc-3pvv.


